<title>CANADA: Canadian oilseeds weekly crushing data.</title>
<headline>Canadian oilseeds weekly crushing data.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Oilseed Processors</p>
<p>Association weekly summary of member crushing, in tonnes -</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING	  CANOLA    SOYBEANS</p>
<p>June 25		46,723    17,925</p>
<p>change prv week   -19.1 pct -34.7 pct</p>
<p>June 18		57,753    27,470</p>
<p>June 11		57,482    28,052</p>
<p>June 4		 49,111    36,926</p>
<p>May 28		 61,158    30,042</p>
